      "cite": "Ruth 4:9-10",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Transfer the sandal",
          "note": "The agreement is sealed before the elders."
        },
        {
          "label": "Join the households",
          "note": "Ruth and Naomi are bound together in redemption."
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "redeemed_2_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Today you are witnesses that I have bought from Naomi all the property of Elimelek, Kilion and Mahlon. I have also acquired Ruth the Moabite, Mahlon's widow, as my wife, so that the name of the dead may be maintained with his property.",
          "position": "middle-left",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "type",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "boaz",
          "align": "left",
          "width": "1/2",
          "zIndex": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "redeemed_3",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "redeemed_3_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "The elders and all the people at the gate said, 'We are witnesses. May the LORD make the woman who is coming into your home like Rachel and Leah, who together built up the house of Israel.'",
          "position": "center",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
